doltgres_scan_sample_next_tuple	bool	TableScanDesc scan, struct SampleScanState *scanstate, TupleTableSlot *slot	error	catalog	a sample scan reads inside a transaction, and its sampling method may read any catalog	test/t/033_scan.pl: TABLESAMPLE over the fork's table gives heap's rows of the same ctids
